.container
  %br/
  .device-background
    .device-text
      %h4 Storage Control Center
      - if current_user
        %p Click 'DTS' to go to our homepage.
      - else
        %p Login to get started or click 'DTS' to go to our homepage.
      = link_to image_tag('dts2.png'), "http://www.dtssoftware.com/", class: "btn btn-primary"
    .device
      .screen
  %br/
  .comment
    .comment-image
      %img{:alt => "Logo image", :src => "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thoughtbot/refills/master/source/images/placeholder_logo_2.png"}/
    .comment-content
      %h1 Announcement
      %p IBM z/OS 2.1 has substantial changes to internal SMS control blocks that required source changes to ACC, SRS and SMSDEBUG. The updates affect all SMS controlled data sets - both VSAM and non-VSAM. If you are upgrading to z/OS 2.1, you must install the latest release of SCC 6.1
